Adapted modules (one line per module, filled in by each task):

- src/h264/: from crates/h264 (the H.264 decoder), crates/h264enc (the encoder) and crates/bitstream (bit reader and writer).
- src/hevc/: from crates/hevc (the H.265 decoder) and crates/bitstream (bit reader, NAL splitting); adapted to the shared Frame and Packet types, with an hvcC writer added.
- src/aac/: from crates/aac (the AAC-LC decoder and encoder) and crates/bitstream; src/aac/pcm.rs is new.
- src/mp4/: from crates/isobmff (the MP4 and MOV reader and writer); remux and the MOV brand are new.
- src/gpu/: decode from crates/platform/src/vaapi (the VA-API front ends, libva FFI and session) and crates/platform/src/biplanar.rs, with the H.264 and HEVC parameter, slice and DPB code of crates/h264 and crates/hevc in src/gpu/syntax; the VA-API encoders, packed headers, VPP and dma-buf export are new.
- src/gpu/nvenc/: from crates/platform/src/nvenc (ffi, session, device, HEVC).
- src/gpu/videotoolbox/: from crates/platform/src/videotoolbox.rs and videotoolbox_encode.rs.
- src/gpu/media_foundation/: from crates/platform/src/media_foundation and crates/platform/src/annexb.rs.
- src/filter/: the EBU R128 meter (K-weighting filters, gating histogram, loudness range) and the true-peak polyphase oversampler from crates/audio-dsp; the rest is new.
- src/vp9/: the VP9 decoder from crates/vp9 (header and superframe parsing, boolean decoder, probability adaptation, tiles, prediction, transforms, loop filter, frame threading); the shared Frame and Packet front and the bit reader (from crates/bitstream) are adapted.
- src/opus/: the decoder (SILK, CELT, hybrid, multistream, OpusHead) from crates/opus; the range encoder, the FFT butterflies and the Ogg reader and writer are new.
- src/mkv/: the Matroska and WebM reader (EBML, lacing, Cues, damage resync) from crates/matroska; the writer, remux and MP4 to MKV are reworked or new.
- src/vp9/enc/: the VP9 encoder; its motion vector prediction (mvref.rs) and the syntax contexts of entropy.rs mirror crates/vp9's tile.rs, and it reuses the decoder's tables, probability adaptation and loop filter; the rest is new.
- src/gif/: new, written from the GIF89a specification; no code adapted.
- src/vp9/enc/tx/: the inverse DCT and ADST butterflies (transform_gen.rs), the scan, band and energy-class tables and the coefficient-context neighbours from crates/vp9; the forward transforms (the transposes of those butterflies), the quantiser, the trellis and the AVX2 kernels are new.
- src/webp/: new, written from RFC 9649 (the container, VP8L lossless and animation); src/webp/vp8/ is described below.
- src/opus/enc/: the CELT encoder is new, written from RFC 6716; it shares the decoder's tables and range coder.

