src/webp/vp8/ (the VP8 lossy codec of WebP) is written from RFC 6386 and
RFC 9649. Its loop filter, intra prediction, token and transform details
follow the reference decoder published in RFC 6386, Section 20, and its YUV
to RGB conversion, fancy chroma upsampler, SSE2 loop filter layout, forward
transforms and quality scale are adapted from libwebp (v1.6.0,
https://chromium.googlesource.com/webm/libwebp). They carry these notices:

